  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/04/IMG_8870.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Se ha celebrado el viernes 12 y el s&aacute;bado 13 de abril en la carpa instalada en el aparcamiento del Recinto Multiusos, que se utilizar&aacute; tambi&eacute;n para la Pascua Sonora y el festival Remembre del 4 de mayo. Ha habido actuaciones musicales, concentraci&oacute;n de caballistas, bailes y gastronom&iacute;a, con calor durante el d&iacute;a y bastante fr&iacute;o durante la noche.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaabrilonda19/img_8515.jpg\" alt=\"img_8515\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaabrilonda19/img_8516.jpg\" alt=\"img_8516\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaabrilonda19/img_8517.jpg\" alt=\"img_8517\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaabrilonda19/img_8519.jpg\" alt=\"img_8519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaabrilonda19/img_8520.jpg\" alt=\"img_8520\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaabrilonda19/img_8522.jpg\" alt=\"img_8522\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaabrilonda19/img_8523.jpg\" alt=\"img_8523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaabrilonda19/img_8527.jpg\" alt=\"img_8527\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaabrilonda19/img_8530.jpg\" alt=\"img_8530\" style=\"max-width:100%;height: